WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.675
RCMP Commissioners — 4 Leaders, Systemic Failures.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:10.062
Canada's national police force has been led by 4 Commissioners since 2000.

00:00:10.062 --> 00:00:17.787
Each tenure was defined by institutional failures, political interference allegations, and resistance to reform.

00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:20.725
Maher Arar was deported to torture.

00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:25.887
22 people died in Nova Scotia while the RCMP issued no alert.

00:00:25.887 --> 00:00:29.437
Political interference shaped investigations.

00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:31.437
This is their record.
